sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 담당자
    participant V as Vue
    participant C as AiTaskController
    participant QS as QuoteService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant CO as AnalysisConsumer
    participant AG as Agent 서버
    participant SP as Spring /internal
    participant SSE as SseHub

    담당자->>V: 견적 검토 후 승인 / 반려
    V->>C: POST /api/ai/tasks/{id}/approval {quoteId, decision, reason}
    C->>C: JWT 역할 확인 (MANAGER)
    C->>QS: approve(quoteId) 또는 reject(quoteId, reason)

    alt 승인
        QS->>DB: UPDATE quotes SET APPROVED WHERE status = DRAFT
        QS->>DB: UPDATE ai_tasks SET REVALIDATING WHERE status = WAITING_APPROVAL
        Note over QS,DB: 영향 행 0건이면 409 (이미 처리됨)
        QS->>MQ: analysis.resume (kind = APPROVED)
        C-->>V: 202
        MQ->>CO: 전달
        CO->>AG: POST /runs/{threadId}/resume
        AG->>SP: 최신 재고 · 가격 재조회 (business MCP)
        alt 조건 변경
            AG->>SP: POST /internal/quotes (새 DRAFT)
            SP->>SSE: APPROVAL_REQUIRED (재승인)
        else 변경 없음
            AG->>SP: POST /internal/quotes/{id}/register
            SP->>DB: UPDATE quotes SET REGISTERED WHERE status = APPROVED
            SP->>DB: rfqs → QUOTED, ai_tasks → DONE
            Note over SP,DB: 이미 REGISTERED면 200 ALREADY_PROCESSED
            SP->>SSE: DONE
        end
    else 반려
        QS->>DB: UPDATE quotes SET REJECTED, reject_reason
        QS->>DB: UPDATE ai_tasks SET RUNNING
        QS->>MQ: analysis.resume (kind = REJECTED, returnTo)
        C-->>V: 202
        MQ->>CO: 전달
        CO->>AG: resume → 지정 단계로 복귀 (견적 재작성 등)
    end
    SSE-->>V: 완료 이벤트
